  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"uab17b7e9\" id=\"uab17b7e9\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf1f0716f\" id=\"uf1f0716f\">函数（function）是程序非常重要的组成部分，是计算机执行命令的单元；</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u14ae17ac\" id=\"u14ae17ac\"><span data-lake-id=\"udcbfe84d\" id=\"udcbfe84d\">所谓</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u03fbdafb\" id=\"u03fbdafb\">函数</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4dbb43dc\" id=\"u4dbb43dc\">，就是把 具有独立功能的代码块 组织为一个整体，在需要的时候 调用；</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uce2081b1\" id=\"uce2081b1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0171bbdc\" id=\"u0171bbdc\">使用函数可以提高编写的效率以及</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6751d155\" id=\"u6751d155\">代码的重用</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"zsqbF\" id=\"zsqbF\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1450ef1b\" id=\"u1450ef1b\">函数的定义和调用</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ua316fcce\" id=\"ua316fcce\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7dc08541\" id=\"u7dc08541\">函数的使用包含两个步骤:</span></p><ol list=\"u25f3ce1f\"><li fid=\"ue82c3207\" data-lake-id=\"u8b12599f\" id=\"u8b12599f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc94b353d\" id=\"uc94b353d\">定义函数 —— 在函数中编写代码，实现功能</span></li><li fid=\"ue82c3207\" data-lake-id=\"u1cdd0bb0\" id=\"u1cdd0bb0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4da108e2\" id=\"u4da108e2\">调用函数 —— 执行编写的代码</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%90%8D()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%B0%81%E8%A3%85%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22m6H8O%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u64fd0f82\" id=\"u64fd0f82\"><code data-lake-id=\"u7d68df19\" id=\"u7d68df19\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc800f1cb\" id=\"uc800f1cb\">def</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ucfd66bcd\" id=\"ucfd66bcd\">是英文</span><code data-lake-id=\"u6dd11536\" id=\"u6dd11536\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1ed5b14f\" id=\"u1ed5b14f\">define</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5587f493\" id=\"u5587f493\">的缩写；</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9cb013d8\" id=\"u9cb013d8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u76019cc1\" id=\"u76019cc1\">函数名的命名规则和变量的命名规则要保持一致</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud009dcf1\" id=\"ud009dcf1\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7eace36d\" id=\"u7eace36d\">实现</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cndef%20say_hello()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20print('hello%20world')%5Cn%20%20%20%20print('hello%20world')%5Cn%20%20%20%20print('hello%20world')%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cnsay_hello()%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VtYFB%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"sACpa\" id=\"sACpa\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uda58eec0\" id=\"uda58eec0\">函数的参数</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u4600f193\" id=\"u4600f193\"><span data-lake-id=\"uea81793e\" id=\"uea81793e\">函数的参数，可以传递数据给函数内部<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"uad397272\" id=\"uad397272\">参数的作用是增加函数的 通用性</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"pEJiV\" id=\"pEJiV\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8cd12218\" id=\"u8cd12218\">参数的定义和调用</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cndef%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%90%8D(%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B01%2C%20%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B02)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%23%20%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cn%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%90%8D(%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B01%2C%20%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B02)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lJKOp%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"qVKOU\" id=\"qVKOU\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua2ec4977\" id=\"ua2ec4977\">参数的使用</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20sum(a%2Cb)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%98%AF%E6%B1%82%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%92%8C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20a%3A%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20b%3A%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20a%E5%92%8Cb%E7%9A%84%E5%92%8C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20result%20%3D%20a%20%2B%20b%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(result)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%5Cnsum(10%2C20)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tcSjo%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"PeRLx\" id=\"PeRLx\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uecd3e6a4\" id=\"uecd3e6a4\">局部变量</span></h3><ul list=\"u0f159327\"><li fid=\"u039a8220\" data-lake-id=\"u3cbf689a\" id=\"u3cbf689a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf9e82ab0\" id=\"uf9e82ab0\">局部变量</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8edbf99f\" id=\"u8edbf99f\">，指的是在</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u05c7f22d\" id=\"u05c7f22d\">函数内部</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u994104e8\" id=\"u994104e8\">定义的变量</span></li><li fid=\"u039a8220\" data-lake-id=\"u08726ef1\" id=\"u08726ef1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4b71d339\" id=\"u4b71d339\">局部变量的目的是</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uce6c3148\" id=\"uce6c3148\">存储需要临时保存的数据</span></strong></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20func1()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%B1%80%E9%83%A8%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cn%20%20%20%20b%20%3D%2020%5Cn%20%20%20%20print('hello%25d'%20%25%20b)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Py8FH%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"dntIZ\" id=\"dntIZ\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue56c3699\" id=\"ue56c3699\">全局变量</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ua66ed695\" id=\"ua66ed695\"><span data-lake-id=\"u67af65e0\" id=\"u67af65e0\">全局变量是在整个py文件中声明，全局范围内都可以访问</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cnm%20%3D%2010%5Cnn%20%3D%2020%5Cn%5Cndef%20func()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%86%85%E8%AE%BF%E9%97%AE%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(m)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wbneP%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"iLJzM\" id=\"iLJzM\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc03aedae\" id=\"uc03aedae\">函数内修改全局变量</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ubcdfdf81\" id=\"ubcdfdf81\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub776333f\" id=\"ub776333f\">如果要在函数内部修改全局变量 需要首先使用global关键字将声明全局变量</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cnm%20%3D%2010%5Cn%5Cndef%20func()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8global%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cn%20%20%20%20global%20m%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%B0%86m%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E6%88%9020%5Cn%20%20%20%20m%20%3D%2030%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(%5C%22%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%20m%3D%5C%22%2C%20m)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EWylQ%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"RBoV3\" id=\"RBoV3\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u894d2aab\" id=\"u894d2aab\">字典简介</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"udbc6a0fd\" id=\"udbc6a0fd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7cc083a7\" id=\"u7cc083a7\">dictionary（字典） 是 除列表以外 Python 之中 最灵活 的数据类型，类型为</span><code data-lake-id=\"u22041607\" id=\"u22041607\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6600a444\" id=\"u6600a444\">dict</span></code></p><ul list=\"u1b3f2a44\"><li fid=\"u1d723a6c\" data-lake-id=\"uf3de1ae2\" id=\"uf3de1ae2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub74d16cd\" id=\"ub74d16cd\">字典同样可以用来存储</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u141dee33\" id=\"u141dee33\">多个数据</span></strong></li><li fid=\"u1d723a6c\" data-lake-id=\"uc3756151\" id=\"uc3756151\"><span data-lake-id=\"u08f889bb\" id=\"u08f889bb\">字典使用</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua6da4867\" id=\"ua6da4867\">键值对</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucffb4ae4\" id=\"ucffb4ae4\">存储数据</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ue542f6cb\" id=\"ue542f6cb\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1684650687460-9048427c-e148-411e-b9da-641418b6138d.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u15b9f293-a24a-4b59-ae8f-27558a52f42%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u4bf5a2e4-7b36-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A251%2C%22originHeight%22%3A219%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f5f4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ucfc7ad23%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"ydTTT\" id=\"ydTTT\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3fc4dbe1\" id=\"u3fc4dbe1\">字典的定义</span></h2><ul list=\"u0d5a7b12\"><li fid=\"u77b3912d\" data-lake-id=\"ue9372cc8\" id=\"ue9372cc8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1ebe211e\" id=\"u1ebe211e\">字典用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u8e95e906\" id=\"u8e95e906\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue37af856\" id=\"ue37af856\">{}</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ufe097674\" id=\"ufe097674\">定义</span></li><li fid=\"u77b3912d\" data-lake-id=\"u72529f45\" id=\"u72529f45\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubf428f17\" id=\"ubf428f17\">键值对之间使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u6358f32e\" id=\"u6358f32e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u13ae6219\" id=\"u13ae6219\">,</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u86250bc0\" id=\"u86250bc0\">分隔</span></li><li fid=\"u77b3912d\" data-lake-id=\"ude510b34\" id=\"ude510b34\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u79bd40e0\" id=\"u79bd40e0\">键</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3ebd57cb\" id=\"u3ebd57cb\">和</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud004c390\" id=\"ud004c390\">值</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u67e9774d\" id=\"u67e9774d\">之间使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u3491c09c\" id=\"u3491c09c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u600dcdc9\" id=\"u600dcdc9\">:</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6b3f9bad\" id=\"u6b3f9bad\">分隔</span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d%20%3D%20%7B'%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD'%3A'China'%2C'%E8%8B%B1%E5%9B%BD'%3A'England'%2C'%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD'%3A'America'%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22y3dX9%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"bVlNi\" id=\"bVlNi\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud9d4a336\" id=\"ud9d4a336\">字典的特点</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u3b3d39bd\" id=\"u3b3d39bd\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucca1632c\" id=\"ucca1632c\">字典中的</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3e56814e\" id=\"u3e56814e\">键</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf2c26854\" id=\"uf2c26854\">相当于索引，必须是</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u51bc57d6\" id=\"u51bc57d6\">唯一的</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d%20%3D%20%7B'%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD'%3A'China'%2C'%E8%8B%B1%E5%9B%BD'%3A'England'%2C'%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD'%3A'America'%2C'%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD'%3A'USA'%7D%5Cnprint(d)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22F2UEr%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card>",
